DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_163D_C117';
<p>163d_c117</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene B</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>bumpy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene B</span> has a skin texture that is not smooth, but rough with small bumps all over.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #00697f;">Gene K</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #00697f;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #00697f;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #7441a6;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, kidney, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">19,176</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,889</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">25,155</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,592</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,596</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">25,300</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,944</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">19,348</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">110,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>Y</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>Y</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_163D_C117
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(1,592 + 1,596 + 8,889 + 19,176)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>31,253</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.2841 = <strong>28.41 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(1,592 + 1,596 + 8,889 + 8,944)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>21,021</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.1911 = <strong>19.11 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(1,592 + 1,596 + 8,944 + 25,300)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>37,432</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.3403 = <strong>34.03 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(1,592 + 8,889 + 8,944 + 25,155)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>44,580</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.4053 = <strong>40.53 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(1,596 + 8,944 + 19,348 + 25,300)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>55,188</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.5017 = <strong>50.17 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(25,155 + 25,300)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>50,455</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.4587 = <strong>45.87 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_163D_C117_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(1,592 + 1,596 + 8,889 + 8,944)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>21,021</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.1911 = <strong>19.11 cM</strong>
LITERAL_163D_C117_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
